{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004159","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004159"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004159","label":"任鄙（樗里子甘茂列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"任鄙","mention_ids":["c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0097"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0097","chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p006","quote":"任鄙"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"任鄙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004159","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji071-018","person_id":"cbr-p004159","surfaces":["任鄙"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-071-chugan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p006","quote":"昭王七年，樗里子卒，葬于渭南章臺之東。曰：「後百歲，是當有天子之宮夾我墓。」樗里子疾室在於昭王廟西渭南陰鄉樗裏，故俗謂之樗里子。至漢興，長樂宮在其東，未央宮在其西，武庫正直其墓。秦人諺曰：「力則任鄙，智則樗裏。」"}],"rationale":"依前6段明示名字與局部敘事暫接，樗里子名疾與智囊嚴君明示相配。樗裏只取末句人物比擬，不取陰鄉地名；預言天子不補漢代皇帝。惠王、武王、昭王依卒立分辨；未名韓女、蒲守與衛君不補姓名，異母不補惠王母。游騰引古知伯齊桓公不當同期在場者。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:p006","text":"昭王七年，樗里子卒，葬于渭南章臺之東。曰：「後百歲，是當有天子之宮夾我墓。」樗里子疾室在於昭王廟西渭南陰鄉樗裏，故俗謂之樗里子。至漢興，長樂宮在其東，未央宮在其西，武庫正直其墓。秦人諺曰：「力則任鄙，智則樗裏。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004149","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004142","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-071-chugan:m006-0029","start":29,"end":31,"s